From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:03:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] WASAPI: retry rejected GameCore stream initialization

FMOD's GameCore backend initializes two probe clients successfully, but
its final stream has flags 0x01040000. Wine rejects the additional bit
with E_INVALIDARG, after which FMOD stops all clients and emits no audio.

Patch the system audio client's shared Initialize slot, preserving the
original call. Retry only E_INVALIDARG requests containing 0x01000000,
removing that bit and returning the real retry result. Keep all other
arguments, accepted requests and unrelated errors unchanged. Pin the
implementation module and release the setup COM objects/apartment.

Includes a regression test that fails with pass-through initialization.

